<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston starts Brazil steels.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston starts Brazil steels.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said analyst Mike Moskowitz initiated coverage of several Brazilian steel stocks.</p>
<p>-- Usiminas was initiated with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- the following were initiated as hold: CSN (Companhia Siderurgica Nacional SA, Acesita SA, Cosipa, and CST.</p>
</text>
